  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency winterization response for vulnerable population groups</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed at restoring residential buildings in the Kherson region is a crucial initiative to improve living conditions for the residents of this area. The objective of the project for minor housing repairs is to enhance the quality of life and increase the comfort for the beneficiaries, whose homes suffered during military actions. Through this project, we aim to improve the living conditions of the beneficiaries significantly.The distribution of aid is organized starting with the most vulnerable individuals, including people with disabilities, pensioners, and single mothers; they will receive assistance as a priority. Next in line are individuals who have not left their homes, followed by those who have decided to return or have already returned</narrative>
  </description>
